<title>DENMARK: Danish November new car yr/yr sales rose three pct.</title>
<headline>Danish November new car yr/yr sales rose three pct.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish new car registrations rose 3.0 percent in November to 10,532 from 10,224 a year earlier, the Automobile Importers' Society said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>				     Nov 1996   Nov 1995</p>
<p>    New car registrations	10,532   10,224</p>
<p>Leading November registrations by manufacturer</p>
<p>    Volkswagen AG	   1,481</p>
<p>    Toyota		    1,102</p>
<p>    Ford Motor Co	   1,034</p>
<p>    General Motors Corp     945</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman,Copenhagen Newsroom, +45-33-969650</p>
</text>
